   381	|---|---|---|---|
   382	| No dedicated field | 0/24 [0–14 %] | 4/16 [10–49 %] · 4/24 | 0/24 [0–14 %] |
   383	| Free-form `notes` field | 10/24 [24–61 %] | 6/15 [20–64 %] · 6/24 | 1/24 [1–20 %] |
   384	| Schema field naming the fact | **24/24 [86–100 %]** | **16/16 [81–100 %]** · 16/24 | **16/24 [47–82 %]** |
   385	| Reminder attached to the observation | **24/24 [86–100 %]** | **15/15 [80–100 %]** · 15/24 | 0/24 [0–14 %] |
