   392	|---|---|---|---|
   393	| No reminder (pooled) | 1/72 [0–7 %] | 21/62 [23–46 %] · 21/72 | 0/72 [0–5 %] |
   394	| Reminder on the observation | **23/24 [80–99 %]** | **18/19 [75–99 %]** · 18/24 | **17/24 [51–85 %]** |
   395	
