   496	This is the section that separates this from a blog post, and the one that cost us most.
   497	
   498	**Nine artefacts catalogued** in the first block, all with the same signature: an
   499	implicit contract between runtime and model. The runtime assumed something it never
   500	declared, and the result depended on whether the model guessed right. The first three
   501	cost entire grids; **two surfaced in the audit before publication, and both had produced
   502	a written result, with tables and intervals, ready to send**.
